---
import '../../styles/framework.css';

const webinarHref = '#webinar-form';
---

<section id="framework" class="framework-section section-pad">
  <div class="container split-grid">
    <div class="section-copy">
      <p class="label muted">Assessment pathway</p>
      <h2>Four signals are stronger than one marksheet.</h2>
      <p>
        The full assessment package goes deeper than the webinar by mapping the student's ability, temperament,
        interests, and study orientation into a practical stream and career discussion.
      </p>
      <a href={webinarHref} class="text-link">Begin with the Rs.99 webinar</a>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar-grid" aria-label="Four assessment pillars">
      <article class="pillar-card">
        <span>Aptitude</span>
        <h3>Reasoning horsepower</h3>
        <p>Logical, numerical, verbal, and spatial processing indicators.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar-card">
        <span>Personality</span>
        <h3>Pressure and fit</h3>
        <p>How the student responds to structure, independence, and stress.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar-card">
        <span>Interests</span>
        <h3>Long-term pull</h3>
        <p>Patterns that help separate temporary hobbies from durable preference.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar-card">
        <span>Study style</span>
        <h3>Execution habits</h3>
        <p>Learning patterns that affect marks, confidence, and consistency.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
